    {
      "who": "LEO",
      "text": "So what do scientists think?"
    },
    {
      "who": "MIA",
      "text": "One big idea is that a yawn helps cool down your brain, with a big gulp of air.",
      "board": {
        "type": "big",
        "icon": "🧠",
